⚡️🇺🇸 The USDA put out some very strange data regarding beef exports. They overstated beef export sales to Chile by 10472% and Italy by 9221%, in addition to overstating twelve other countries.

Once the USDA fixed these numbers, beef export sales numbers went down by 90% for the previous period, a ridiculous revision.

